# Always Use Quickmerge

RULE: ALWAYS run `bash scripts/quickmerge.sh "message"`. NEVER run `scripts/quality-gates.sh` standalone. Use `--dep-branch` when dependencies differ from main. Branch protection rejects direct push to main.
WHY: Quickmerge runs dependency validation, pre-flight audit, quality gates, Act simulation, and PR creation. Standalone quality gates miss critical checks.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/quality-gates.md

DO:
  bash scripts/quickmerge.sh "feat: add feature"
  bash scripts/quickmerge.sh "update" --dep-branch "my-feature"  # when deps differ
  bash git-quickmerge.sh "update" --all  # multiple repos

NEVER:
  bash scripts/quality-gates.sh  # standalone
  git add -A && git commit && git push
  Finish with uncommitted changes in any modified repo
